                 "No worries at all! Just scan this QR code right here on your phone and it'll enter you in the general drawing. Have a great day with that project!"
                 <div style="margin-top:8px; padding-top:8px; border-top:1px dashed #2563EB; font-size:14px; font-weight:800;">
